{"ts":1781473470933,"state_hash":"8a418d37bd6e0ef7","passage":"Canvas_aud_tuition_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: You fix everything (aud_tuition) | Node: You fix everything\n\n\n\n[IMAGE MISSING] scenes/aud_tuition.jpg\n\nYou find Audrey cross-legged on her childhood bed with a letter she's already crumpled and smoothed flat too many times. A final notice from the bursar — the fees, the date, the word withdrawn. She's been crying the quiet way, the way that doesn't want to be heard down the hall, and when she sees you in the doorway her face does the thing it's always done with you: it lets go, because you're here, and you've always been the one who makes the bad thing stop.\n\nThey're going to throw me out, Catherine. Mom always handled it and now there's no one and I didn't know who else — I'm sorry, I shouldn't have, you just got home —\n\nYou take the letter out of her hands and read the number and it's nothing — a rounding error against what runs through the hotel's accounts now that they run through you. You tell her it's handled. You'll see the bursar, the fees are covered, she's not going anywhere. You don't tell her whose money or what it costs the rest of them. You just watch the terror drain out of her shoulders and the gratitude pour in to fill the space it leaves.\n\n💭 Audrey is thinking: I knew it. I knew the second she walked back in this house it would be okay. She always knows what to do.\n💭 You are thinking: Cheaper than a night's bar take, and she'll spend the rest of the year learning to need me. Money well placed.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTell her it's handled.","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> You fix everything <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(aud_tuition)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> You fix everything</div><br><div style=\"border:2px dashed #666;padding:20px;margin:10px 0;border-radius:8px;background:#f5f5f5;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-weight:bold;color:#333;\">[IMAGE MISSING] scenes/aud_tuition.jpg</p></div><p>You find Audrey cross-legged on her childhood bed with a letter she's already crumpled and smoothed flat too many times. A final notice from the bursar — the fees, the date, the word withdrawn. She's been crying the quiet way, the way that doesn't want to be heard down the hall, and when she sees you in the doorway her face does the thing it's always done with you: it lets go, because you're here, and you've always been the one who makes the bad thing stop.</p><p>They're going to throw me out, Catherine. Mom always handled it and now there's no one and I didn't know who else — I'm sorry, I shouldn't have, you just got home —</p><span id=\"cascade-c556eb3c-4a49-442e-8b1d-5019fb2817c5-beat-0\"><p>You take the letter out of her hands and read the number and it's nothing — a rounding error against what runs through the hotel's accounts now that they run through you. You tell her it's handled. You'll see the bursar, the fees are covered, she's not going anywhere. You don't tell her whose money or what it costs the rest of them. You just watch the terror drain out of her shoulders and the gratitude pour in to fill the space it leaves.</p><div class=\"thought-bubble thought-bubble-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"thought-bubble-content\"><em>💭 Audrey is thinking:</em> I knew it. I knew the second she walked back in this house it would be okay. She always knows what to do.</div></div><div class=\"thought-bubble thought-bubble-player\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"thought-bubble-content\"><em>💭 You are thinking:</em> Cheaper than a night's bar take, and she'll spend the rest of the year learning to need me. Money well placed.</div></div></span><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><a data-passage=\"Location_Audrey's_Room\" class=\"link-internal\" tabindex=\"0\">Tell her it's handled.</a>","modal_text":null,"variables_snapshot":{"last_game_passage":"Canvas_aud_tuition_Node_1","player":{"name":"Catherine","portrait":"catherine.jpg","current_location":"a2e68cd4-af85-4dab-bc5e-2f355017faac","core_traits":{"corruption":0,"arousal":0,"energy":100,"hygiene":100,"money":50,"exhibitionism":0,"audrey_stage":0,"grayson_stage":0,"richard_stage":0,"margaret_stage":0},"wardrobe":{"in_bra":{"id":"in_bra","name":"Plain Bra","slot":"bra","image":"./videos/clothing/in_bra.jpg"},"in_briefs":{"id":"in_briefs","name":"Plain Briefs","slot":"underwear","image":"./videos/clothing/in_briefs.jpg"},"in_blouse":{"id":"in_blouse","name":"Linen Blouse","slot":"top","image":"./videos/clothing/in_blouse.jpg"},"in_slacks":{"id":"in_slacks","name":"Tailored Slacks","slot":"bottom","image":"./videos/clothing/in_slacks.jpg"},"in_flats":{"id":"in_flats","name":"Flats","slot":"shoes","image":"./videos/clothing/in_flats.jpg"},"in_day_dress":{"id":"in_day_dress","name":"Day Dress","slot":"dress","image":"./videos/clothing/in_day_dress.jpg"}},"equipped":{"bra":"in_bra","underwear":"in_briefs","top":"in_blouse","bottom":"in_slacks","dress":"in_day_dress","legwear":null,"shoes":"in_flats"},"body_type":"average","look":"composed"},"npcs":{"f8b6da59-9955-4300-b46e-662426238c45":{"name":"Audrey","portrait":"audrey.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":2,"corruption":2,"relation":15},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"1569a9d0-eef1-47a0-86c0-d7c49889a136":{"name":"Grayson","portrait":"grayson.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":0,"corruption":0,"relation":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"c47e428a-bc10-4277-a995-148efc3bbcdb":{"name":"Richard","portrait":"richard.jpg","core_traits":{"arousal":0,"corruption